<title>POLAND: PBR MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 6.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 6.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.30 vs    1.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.87 vs    2.15</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 18.86 vs    6.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	17.31 vs   14.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.12 vs    8.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   14.25 vs   15.18</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 27.51 vs   24.18</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	51.59 vs   49.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
